    "realestate.faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "realestate.faq.subtitle": "Find answers to common questions about our AI call agent for real estate.",
    "realestate.faq.q1": "What is an AI call agent for real estate?",
    "realestate.faq.a1": "An AI call agent for real estate is an intelligent voice system that automatically answers incoming property calls, qualifies leads, and books appointments. Agent On Demand acts as your 24/7 virtual receptionist, ensuring no buyer, seller, or rental inquiry is ever missed.",
    "realestate.faq.q2": "How does Agent On Demand handle real estate calls?",
    "realestate.faq.a2": "When a call comes in, Agent On Demand answers instantly, understands whether the caller is buying, selling, or renting, collects key details like budget and location, and either schedules a viewing or transfers the call to your team if needed.",
    "realestate.faq.q3": "Can the AI call agent book property viewings automatically?",
    "realestate.faq.a3": "Yes. Agent On Demand integrates with your calendar (Google Calendar and Outlook) and can schedule property viewings, consultations, or callbacks in real time based on your availability.",
    "realestate.faq.q4": "Does it work outside business hours?",
    "realestate.faq.a4": "Yes. The AI call agent for real estate works 24/7, including evenings, weekends, and holidays. This ensures you never lose leads from after-hours property inquiries.",
    "realestate.faq.q5": "Can Agent On Demand qualify buyers and sellers?",
    "realestate.faq.a5": "Yes. It asks structured questions to understand intent, budget, timeline, and property preferences, allowing your team to focus only on serious and high-intent leads.",
    "realestate.faq.q6": "Will it replace my real estate receptionist?",
    "realestate.faq.a6": "It replaces repetitive call handling tasks, not your sales team. Instead of manually answering inquiries, your team receives pre-qualified leads and can focus on closing deals and client relationships.",
    "realestate.faq.q7": "Can it handle rental and tenant inquiries?",
    "realestate.faq.a7": "Yes. Agent On Demand can manage rental inquiries, tenant questions, maintenance requests, and application-related calls efficiently.",
    "realestate.faq.q8": "Does it integrate with CRM systems?",
    "realestate.faq.a8": "Yes. All lead data, call summaries, and customer details can be synced with your CRM so your sales pipeline stays organized and updated automatically.",
    "realestate.faq.q9": "How natural does the AI sound on calls?",
    "realestate.faq.a9": "The AI is designed to sound natural and professional, capable of holding human-like conversations in English, German, and other supported languages while maintaining a consistent brand tone.",
    "realestate.faq.q10": "How quickly can I set up Agent On Demand?",
    "realestate.faq.a10": "Most real estate businesses can get started within a few hours. Setup includes connecting your phone line, calendar, and providing basic business and property information.",
    "realestate.finalcta.title": "Start Automating Your Real Estate Calls Today",
