    "receptionist.hero.subtitle": "Your customers call when they need you most. Not when you are available.",
    "gym.hero.subtitle": "The Smartest Way to Handle Member Calls, Book Classes, and Capture Gym Leads 24/7",
    "automotive.hero.subtitle": "The Smartest Way to Handle Customer Calls, Book Service Appointments, and Capture Sales Leads 24/7",
    "outbound.hero.subtitle": "Most businesses wait for customers to call. But the highest value opportunities are often created, not captured.",
    "receptionist.hero.description": "Every Call Deserves an Instant Answer",
    "gym.hero.description": "Turn Every Fitness Inquiry Into a Membership, Booking, or Trial Signup",
    "automotive.hero.description": "Turn Every Automotive Call Into a Booked Appointment or Qualified Lead",
    "outbound.hero.description": "Intelligent AI Outbound Calling That Converts Every Lead",
    "receptionist.hero.para1": "Customers do not wait for availability. They call when they need something. Most businesses cannot respond to every call in real time. Agent On Demand fills that gap with an AI receptionist that responds instantly, speaks naturally, and handles real customer conversations without delay.",
    "gym.hero.para1": "An AI call agent for fitness businesses helps gyms, fitness studios, personal trainers, and wellness centers respond instantly to every call without losing potential members.",
    "automotive.hero.para1": "An AI call agent for automotive businesses helps dealerships, repair shops, service centers, and auto businesses answer every customer call instantly without increasing staffing costs.",
    "outbound.hero.para1": "Agent On Demand’s outbound AI receptionist helps you proactively reach leads, follow up with customers, and re-engage lost opportunities through natural, intelligent voice conversations.",
    "receptionist.hero.para2": "It answers questions, books appointments, qualifies leads, transfers calls when needed, and keeps your business responsive at all times, even when your team is offline. It also remembers returning callers, understands context across conversations, and adapts its tone based on customer intent and urgency.",
    "gym.hero.para2": "With Agent On Demand, every call is answered, every class is booked, and every membership inquiry is handled automatically—even outside working hours.",
    "automotive.hero.para2": "With Agent On Demand, every call is answered, every service request is managed, and every sales inquiry is captured automatically—even outside business hours.",
    "outbound.hero.para2": "It sounds human, adapts in real time, and turns cold lists into real conversations.",
