    "receptionist.mockup.summaryText": "Markus called regarding the listing at 124 Oak Drive, Milan. He is highly qualified with a pre-approved budget of €450k. He has a golden retriever dog and requested a viewing slot specifically on the ground floor or properties with elevator access. Ava offered Saturday slots and scheduled a viewing.",
    "gym.mockup.summaryText": "David called to book a trial pass. The AI verified open slots, gathered his fitness goals (strength training and power yoga), and booked him into the Power Yoga class on Friday at 6:00 PM with a PT consultation follow-up. Confirmation SMS sent.",
    "automotive.mockup.summaryText": "David called inquiring about a grinding noise in his brakes. The AI answered instantly, confirmed availability, and booked a brake inspection and oil change for Friday at 2:00 PM. Access code and SMS reminder sent.",
