    "receptionist.hero.para1": "Un agente de llamadas de IA para bienes raíces ayuda a las agencias a responder instantáneamente a cada consulta de propiedad sin perder una sola oportunidad.",
    "gym.hero.para1": "An AI call agent for fitness businesses helps gyms, fitness studios, personal trainers, and wellness centers respond instantly to every call without losing potential members.",
    "automotive.hero.para1": "An AI call agent for automotive businesses helps dealerships, repair shops, service centers, and auto businesses answer every customer call instantly without increasing staffing costs.",
    "outbound.hero.para1": "Agent On Demand’s outbound AI receptionist helps you proactively reach leads, follow up with customers, and re-engage lost opportunities through natural, intelligent voice conversations.",
    "receptionist.hero.para2": "Con Agent On Demand, se responde cada llamada, se califica cada cliente potencial y se agenda cada visita automáticamente, incluso fuera del horario de atención.",
