    "outbound.faq.a7": "Yes. The AI asks relevant questions during the call, evaluates responses, and qualifies leads before transferring them to your sales team.",
    "receptionist.faq.q8": "Does it support SMS, email, and WhatsApp follow-ups?",
    "gym.faq.q8": "Does it integrate with booking systems?",
    "automotive.faq.q8": "How natural does the AI sound?",
    "outbound.faq.q8": "What happens if a customer wants to speak to a human?",
    "receptionist.faq.a8": "Yes. After calls, missed calls, or incomplete conversations, the system can automatically send follow-up messages across SMS, email, and WhatsApp.",
    "gym.faq.a8": "Yes. It syncs with calendars and fitness booking tools to manage schedules in real time.",
    "automotive.faq.a8": "The AI uses advanced conversational technology to provide professional, natural-sounding interactions that feel similar to speaking with a human receptionist.",
    "outbound.faq.a8": "The system can instantly transfer the call to a live agent based on your rules, such as high-value leads, urgent requests, or customer preference.",
    "receptionist.faq.q9": "Can I customize how the AI speaks and behaves?",
    "gym.faq.q9": "How natural does it sound?",
    "automotive.faq.q9": "Can it handle multiple calls at once?",
    "outbound.faq.q9": "Can I customize what the AI says during calls?",
    "receptionist.faq.a9": "Yes. You can define tone, communication style, business rules, services, FAQs, and how the AI should handle different types of customer conversations.",
    "gym.faq.a9": "The AI is designed to sound friendly, energetic, and engaging—perfect for fitness customers.",
