    "gym.faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "automotive.faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "outbound.faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "receptionist.faq.subtitle": "Here are answers to common questions about Agent On Demand and how it automates call answering and front desk operations.",
    "gym.faq.subtitle": "Got questions? We've got answers.",
    "automotive.faq.subtitle": "Got questions? We've got answers.",
    "outbound.faq.subtitle": "Got questions? We've got answers.",
    "receptionist.faq.q1": "What is Agent On Demand?",
    "gym.faq.q1": "What is an AI call agent for fitness businesses?",
    "automotive.faq.q1": "What is an AI call agent for automotive businesses?",
    "outbound.faq.q1": "What is AI Outbound Calling?",
    "receptionist.faq.a1": "Agent On Demand is an AI receptionist that answers customer calls instantly, handles real conversations, books appointments, qualifies leads, and follows up automatically across multiple channels like SMS, email, and WhatsApp.",
    "gym.faq.a1": "An AI call agent for fitness businesses is a virtual assistant that automatically answers calls, books classes, handles membership inquiries, and captures new leads for gyms and studios.",
    "automotive.faq.a1": "An AI call agent for automotive businesses is an intelligent voice assistant that automatically answers customer calls, schedules service appointments, qualifies sales leads, and handles inquiries. Agent On Demand acts as a 24/7 virtual receptionist for dealerships and service centers.",
    "outbound.faq.a1": "AI Outbound Calling is a system that automatically calls your leads, customers, or contact lists and holds natural voice conversations. It can follow up, qualify leads, send reminders, and re-engage inactive customers without human intervention.",
    "receptionist.faq.q2": "How does the AI receptionist answer calls?",
    "gym.faq.q2": "How does Agent On Demand help gyms?",
    "automotive.faq.q2": "How does Agent On Demand help automotive businesses?",
    "outbound.faq.q2": "How does the AI decide who to call?",
    "receptionist.faq.a2": "When a customer calls your business, the AI picks up immediately and starts a natural voice conversation. It understands what the caller needs, responds in real time, and takes action such as booking, qualifying, or routing the call.",
    "gym.faq.a2": "It automates member communication, class bookings, and lead handling so staff can focus on training and member experience.",
    "automotive.faq.a2": "It automates customer communication, appointment scheduling, lead qualification, and call handling, allowing staff to focus on servicing customers and closing sales.",
    "outbound.faq.a2": "You upload or connect a list of contacts, and you define the campaign goal. The system then automatically prioritizes and calls contacts based on your rules, timing, and campaign settings.",
    "receptionist.faq.q3": "Does it sound like a real person?",
    "gym.faq.q3": "Can it book gym classes and personal training sessions?",
    "automotive.faq.q3": "Can the AI schedule service appointments?",
    "outbound.faq.q3": "Can the AI have natural conversations or is it scripted?",
    "receptionist.faq.a3": "Yes. The AI is designed for natural, human-like conversations. It understands intent, handles interruptions, and responds dynamically instead of using rigid scripts.",
    "gym.faq.a3": "Yes. It integrates with your scheduling system to book classes, PT sessions, and trial visits automatically.",
    "automotive.faq.a3": "Yes. Agent On Demand can schedule maintenance, repairs, inspections, tire services, and other appointments directly into your calendar system.",
    "outbound.faq.a3": "The AI does not follow rigid scripts. It understands intent, responds dynamically, handles objections, and adapts the conversation based on what the caller says in real time.",
    "receptionist.faq.q4": "Can it handle multiple calls at the same time?",
    "gym.faq.q4": "Does it work after gym hours?",
    "automotive.faq.q4": "Can it handle vehicle sales inquiries?",
    "outbound.faq.q4": "Can it handle follow-ups if the person does not answer?",
    "receptionist.faq.a4": "Yes. Unlike a human receptionist, Agent On Demand can handle unlimited calls simultaneously without busy signals or delays.",
    "gym.faq.a4": "Yes. The AI works 24/7, ensuring no membership inquiry is missed at any time.",
    "automotive.faq.a4": "Yes. The AI collects customer information, vehicle preferences, budget details, and purchase intent before forwarding qualified leads to your sales team.",
    "outbound.faq.a4": "Yes. If a call is not answered, the system can retry automatically, send SMS or WhatsApp messages, or schedule a follow-up call based on your configured rules.",
    "receptionist.faq.q5": "Can it book appointments directly into my calendar?",
    "gym.faq.q5": "Can it handle membership inquiries?",
    "automotive.faq.q5": "Does it work outside business hours?",
    "outbound.faq.q5": "Can I use it for sales campaigns and promotions?",
    "receptionist.faq.a5": "Yes. It integrates with Google Calendar and Outlook to check real-time availability and book appointments automatically with smart scheduling rules.",
    "gym.faq.a5": "Yes. It explains membership options and captures lead details like goals, preferences, and interest level.",
    "automotive.faq.a5": "Yes. The AI call agent operates 24/7, ensuring no customer inquiry is missed during evenings, weekends, or holidays.",
    "outbound.faq.a5": "Yes. You can run outbound campaigns for sales outreach, promotions, event invitations, service reminders, reactivation campaigns, and more.",
