    "automotive.faq.a6": "Yes. Calls requiring personal assistance can be transferred immediately to sales representatives, service advisors, or managers.",
    "outbound.faq.a6": "Yes. Every call is logged, and the system updates lead status, tags interest level, stores transcripts, and syncs data with your CRM in real time.",
